/Title (The mode is the most frequently occurring value. It is the only one of the three measures that is defined for qualitative \(categorical\) attributes as well as quantitative ones - you cannot take the mean of a set of T-shirt sizes, but you can ask which size is bought most often. A distribution can have more than one mode; it is then called multimodal \(bimodal, trimodal, and so on\). )
