/Title (For roughly normally distributed data, approximately 68% of values fall within one standard deviation of the mean, approximately 95% fall within two, and approximately 99.7% fall within three. This single rule underlies z-score anomaly detection, confidence intervals, and statistical process control charts, and it will resurface repeatedly in machine learning. )
